# QuizVerse — project memory

## Product

Cross-platform **AI quiz game** (Flutter + FastAPI). Feels like a polished mobile game, not an AI wrapper.

**Core rule:** gameplay must **never** call an LLM per question. Flow is:

`generate → validate → quality → dedupe → Postgres bank → gameplay API → Flutter`

## Stack

- `mobile/` — Flutter, Riverpod, GoRouter, Dio, dark-first UI; package **`com.quizverse.app`**
- `backend/` — FastAPI, SQLAlchemy async, Alembic, JWT guest/email auth
- `workers/` — background generation / bank top-ups
- `docker-compose.yml` (+ `docker-compose.prod.yml`) — Postgres 16, Redis 7, API, worker
- Emulator API base: `http://10.0.2.2:8000`; any-device testing via Cloudflare tunnel (`scripts/dev_tunnel.ps1`); prod via `--dart-define=API_BASE_URL=https://...`
- Ops docs: `docs/OPEN_AND_RUN.md` (cheat sheet), `docs/AUTH_GOOGLE.md`, `docs/RAILWAY.md`, `docs/HOSTING.md`, `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`, `docs/ENV_PROVIDERS.md`
- Auth: guest bootstrap; `POST /auth/google` + Profile Sign in with Google (`GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`)

