## Ops notes

- Local: `docker compose up` — API `:8000`, docs `/docs`
- Prod overlay: `docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.prod.yml up --build -d`
- Migrations: `0001_initial`, `0002_quiz_question_reuse`, `0003_analytics_events`
- Android Kotlin incremental issue historically: `kotlin.incremental=false` in `mobile/android/gradle.properties`
- Daily: `GET/POST /api/v1/daily-challenge`; boards: `GET /api/v1/leaderboards?scope=weekly|daily`
- Analytics: `ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=postgres|null`
- Entitlements: `ENTITLEMENTS_ENFORCE_QUESTION_CAPS`, `FREE_UNIQUE_QUESTIONS_PER_TOPIC`, `ENTITLEMENTS_DEV_TOGGLE`; `GET /api/v1/entitlements/me`
- Share: `GET /api/v1/share/results/{session_id}` (public); scheme `quizverse://results/{id}`; landing `GET /r/{id}`; `SHARE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`
- App Links: `GET /.well-known/assetlinks.json` + `apple-app-site-association`; package `com.quizverse.app`; `APP_LINK_ANDROID_*`, `APP_LINK_IOS_APP_ID` (empty → 503)
- IAP: `IAP_PREMIUM_PRODUCT_ID`, `IAP_ANDROID_PACKAGE=com.quizverse.app`, `BILLING_VERIFY_MODE=stub|apple_google`; Google `GOOGLE_PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON`; Apple `APPLE_IAP_*` (later)
- Flutter API: `--dart-define=API_BASE_URL=...`; signing: `mobile/android/key.properties`
- Docs: `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`, `docs/ENV_PROVIDERS.md`

### Release checklist (Android-first)

1. Upload keystore + `key.properties`; build signed AAB with prod `API_BASE_URL`
2. Play listing + privacy policy + Data safety; Internal testing track
3. Set `APP_LINK_ANDROID_SHA256_CERT_FINGERPRINTS` from Play App Signing
4. Point `quizverse.app` DNS at API; `SHARE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://quizverse.app`
5. Create Play product matching `IAP_PREMIUM_PRODUCT_ID`; set `GOOGLE_PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON`; `BILLING_VERIFY_MODE=apple_google`
6. License-tester purchase/restore; then production track
7. Later: iOS Team ID / AASA; caps when monetizing
